          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ವರಾಂಡ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವರಾಂಡ — varāṇḍa — \"a veranda\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಂಜೆ ಅಜ್ಜ ವರಾಂಡದಲ್ಲಿ ಕುಳಿತು ಪತ್ರಿಕೆ ಓದುತ್ತಾರೆ. sañje ajja varāṇḍadalli kuḷitu patrike ōduttāre. In the evening grandfather sits on the veranda and reads the paper."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A roofed space along the front of the house; ಜಗಲಿ is the raised one."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವರಾಂಡ (varāṇḍa) is a loan from English veranda."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
