              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕರೆಂಟ್ ಹೋದಾಗ ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಲಾಂದ್ರ ಹಚ್ಚಿದರು. kareṇṭ hōdāga ajji lāndra haccidaru. When the power went off, grandmother lit the lantern."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A glass-covered oil lamp with a handle."
            }
          ]
        },
